apeiron.machine.infinite_me_output_assembly.desc=§bSends both items and fluids to the ME network§r\n§7One ME connection; separate item and fluid buffers§r\n§7Unlimited buffers; storage cells are optional§r\n§7Cells provide partition filtering and cache mode§r\n§7First row: item cell; second row: fluid cell§r\n§7Right-click to set item and fluid output priorities§r\n§eControls: screwdriver toggles both cache modes§r\n§eControls: wire cutter changes ME connection sides§r
apeiron.machine.me_output.fluid_settings=Fluid output settings
apeiron.machine.me_output.item_settings=Item output settings
apeiron.machine.boundless_me_output_bus.desc=§bSends machine item outputs to the ME network§r\n§7Unlimited buffer holds outputs awaiting transfer§r\n§7Works without a storage cell§r\n§7Optional: use an item storage cell for partition filtering§r\n§7Cache mode stores into the installed cell for ME access§r\n§eControls: right-click with a screwdriver to toggle cache mode§r\n§eControls: right-click with a wire cutter to change ME connections§r\n§6Note: accepts item outputs only; provide other outputs separately§r
apeiron.machine.boundless_me_output_hatch.desc=§bSends machine fluid outputs to the ME network§r\n§7Unlimited buffer holds outputs awaiting transfer§r\n§7Works without a storage cell§r\n§7Optional: use an fluid storage cell for partition filtering§r\n§7Cache mode stores into the installed cell for ME access§r\n§eControls: right-click with a screwdriver to toggle cache mode§r\n§eControls: right-click with a wire cutter to change ME connections§r\n§6Note: accepts fluid outputs only; provide other outputs separately§r
