apeiron.machine.infinite_storage_input_bus.desc=§bSupplies machines with items from ME storage§r\n§7360 selection slots; scroll to see them all§r\n§7Select manually or automatically from matching ME stock§r\n§7Item filters: mod, item ID, damage value, ore dictionary§r\n§eSettings: minimum stock for auto-selection and refresh interval§r\n§7Minimum stock accepts scientific notation, e.g. 1E18§r\n§eControls: wire cutter changes connections; data stick copies settings§r\n§6Note: selections are markers; recipes consume the actual resources§r
apeiron.machine.infinite_storage_input_hatch.desc=§bSupplies machines with fluids from ME storage§r\n§7360 selection slots; scroll to see them all§r\n§7Select manually or automatically from matching ME stock§r\n§7Fluid filter: fluid registry name§r\n§eSettings: minimum stock for auto-selection and refresh interval§r\n§7Minimum stock accepts scientific notation, e.g. 1E18§r\n§eControls: wire cutter changes connections; data stick copies settings§r\n§6Note: selections are markers; recipes consume the actual resources§r
